# atomic-save temp files: _save writes campaign.json.tmp<pid> then os.replace()s it.
# A crash between those two steps leaves one behind, and `git add -A` swept 20 into the
# repo before anyone noticed. They are never worth committing.
*.json.tmp*
*.json.prev
